OL,3,GNEWSAMixed ability rugby 'spirit' on
OL,4,Ashow at exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new photographic exhibition
OL,7,Fcelebrates a rugby club for players of
OL,8,Fall abilities, from those with
OL,9,Fdisabilities to former players.
OL,11,FBath Mixed Ability Rugby formed last
OL,12,Fyear when two mixed ability rugby
OL,13,Fclubs, Walcott Warriors and Stothert &
OL,14,FPitt, merged and players train at a
OL,15,Frugby ground in Bristol Road, Bath.
OL,17,FThe free exhibition at Bath Central
OL,18,FLibrary features images by photographer
OL,19,FJon Taylor and runs until 27 September.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
