OL,3,GNEWSAMixed ability rugby 'spirit' on
OL,4,Ashow at exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt aims to capture what Taylor called
OL,7,F"the spirit of the club - training
OL,8,Fsessions in all weathers and players
OL,9,Fsupporting and learning from one
OL,10,Fanother".
